     ----llooccaalliizzee--ssyymmbboollss=_f_i_l_e_n_a_m_e
             Make each symbol listed in the file specified by _f_i_l_e_n_a_m_e local
             to the output file.

     ----nnoo--aaddjjuusstt--wwaarrnniinnggss | ----nnoo--cchhaannggee--wwaarrnniinnggss
